5. All other provisions of Chapter VIII (Specifications related to ISIN for debt securities) of the
NCS Master Circular shall remain unchanged.
6. The provisions of this circular shall come into force with immediate effect.
7. The Stock Exchanges and Depositories are advised to:
7.1. Make amendments to the relevant bye-laws, rules and regulations for the
implementation of the above decision, as may be applicable/ necessary;
7.2. Take all necessary steps and carry out system changes, if any, to implement the
above;
